Services used at run time (not included in this repository):
- SerpApi (https://serpapi.com): Google Flights API and Google Travel Explore API,
  called with the user's own API key and search credits.
- Fare data comes from Google Flights via SerpApi. Fares change constantly;
  always confirm on Google Flights before booking.

The example report image in docs/ was generated by this skill from real
SerpApi results (Taipei TPE to Japan, searched 2026-10-28).
